# 后端开发指南

## 项目结构
- **主启动类**: [jeecg-boot/jeecg-module-system/jeecg-system-start/src/main/java/org/jeecg/JeecgSystemApplication.java](mdc:jeecg-boot/jeecg-module-system/jeecg-system-start/src/main/java/org/jeecg/JeecgSystemApplication.java)
- **核心配置**: [jeecg-boot/pom.xml](mdc:jeecg-boot/pom.xml)
- **业务模块**: jeecg-boot/jeecg-module-system/jeecg-system-biz/

## 编译命令
```bash
# 清理并编译
cd jeecg-boot && mvn clean compile -DskipTests

# 仅编译特定模块
cd jeecg-boot && mvn clean compile -DskipTests -rf :jeecg-system-biz

# 启动应用
cd jeecg-boot/jeecg-module-system/jeecg-system-start && mvn spring-boot:run
```

## 关键依赖
- LiteFlow 流程引擎: 用于 AI 模块的业务流程处理
- Spring Boot 2.7.18
- Java 17

## 常见问题
1. **FlowExecutor bean 缺失**: 确保 AI 模块包含 liteflow-spring-boot-starter 依赖
2. **编译错误**: 检查 Java 版本是否为 17
3. **端口冲突**: 默认端口 8080